{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2121260849595916644","post_url":"https://x.com/colne_x/status/2121260849595916644","author":"@colne_x","posted_at":"2026-11-13T15:16:12Z","collected_at":"2026-11-14T08:20:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-jp","text":"BTCの基本構造は変わらない。\n現在は、健全な調整局面にあります。\n\n来年には、次なる史上最高値（ATH）へ向かうことでしょう。\nノイズに惑わされず、大局を俯瞰しましょう。","post_type":"original","in_reply_to_id":null,"thread_root_id":null,"quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":null,"link_urls":[],"tickers_hint":[],"engagement":{"likes":40,"reposts":4,"replies":3,"views":2009}}\n{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2121257265563041992","post_url":"https://x.com/colne_x/status/2121257265563041992","author":"@colne_x","posted_at":"2026-11-13T15:01:57Z","collected_at":"2026-11-14T08:20:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-jp","text":"米PPI、10月は前年同月比6.5%上昇－2022年以来の大幅な伸び https://www.bloomberg.com/jp/news/articles/2026-11-13/TOG0C8KK3NY800?utm_source=website&utm_medium=share&utm_campaign=twitter","post_type":"original","in_reply_to_id":null,"thread_root_id":null,"quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":null,"link_urls":["https://www.bloomberg.com/jp/news/articles/2026-11-13/TOG0C8KK3NY800"],"tickers_hint":[],"engagement":{"likes":11,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"views":1282}}\n{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2121254393001771197","post_url":"https://x.com/colne_x/status/2121254393001771197","author":"@colne_x","posted_at":"2026-11-13T14:50:32Z","collected_at":"2026-11-14T08:20:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-jp","text":"真っ赤","post_type":"original","in_reply_to_id":null,"thread_root_id":null,"quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":null,"link_urls":[],"tickers_hint":[],"engagement":{"likes":26,"reposts":0,"replies":5,"views":2129}}\n{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2121377579718553814","post_url":"https://x.com/kei_toshi__/status/2121377579718553814","author":"@kei_toshi__","posted_at":"2026-11-13T23:00:02Z","collected_at":"2026-11-14T08:20:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-jp","text":"来週の決算で増配を期待したい銘柄\n\n第1位 「東京海上HD」\n\n決算シーズンも大詰め。来週は東京海上HDが決算。株式分割後に株価は良い感じに上昇中。このタイミングの決算で増配と共にさらなる株価上昇となるか！？！？\n来週の決算を期待したい銘柄。","post_type":"original","in_reply_to_id":null,"thread_root_id":null,"quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":null,"link_urls":[],"tickers_hint":["8766"],"engagement":{"likes":0,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"views":51}}\n{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2121362476713255142","post_url":"https://x.com/kei_toshi__/status/2121362476713255142","author":"@kei_toshi__","posted_at":"2026-11-13T22:00:02Z","collected_at":"2026-11-14T08:20:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-jp","text":"今週買い増しした銘柄！\n\n・NF日経高配当50\n・積水ハウス\n・稲畑産業\n・住友商事\n・みずほリース\n・三菱HCC\n・三井住友FG\n・ヒューリック\n・東京海上HD\n\nこの9銘柄を買い増し！三井住友FGは決算で10円も増配してくれ最高でした。\n皆さんは今週は何を買い増ししましたか...?良かったら教えてください🙇","post_type":"original","in_reply_to_id":null,"thread_root_id":null,"quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":null,"link_urls":[],"tickers_hint":["1928","8098","8053","8425","8593","8316","3003","8766"],"engagement":{"likes":11,"reposts":0,"replies":3,"views":1268}}\n{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2121246103068971442","post_url":"https://x.com/SERIKURA/status/2121246103068971442","author":"@SERIKURA","posted_at":"2026-11-13T14:17:36Z","collected_at":"2026-11-14T08:20:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-jp","text":"《来週の胸熱銘柄🐞》\n\n【7936 アシックス】\n【9984 ソフトバンクグループ】\n【7012 川崎重工】\n【5706 三井金属】\n【5801 古河電工】\n【3905 データセクション】\n【4385 メルカリ】\n【6993 大黒屋】\n【341A トヨコー】\n【288A ラクサス】\n\n相場の底入れももう一息です。\n\nファン氏の騒動で不安になった投資家が投げ売りをしたので更に整地が進みました。\n\nSQと週末利確に押されて不穏な1週間になりましたが、、\n先週の金曜のセリクラ後は素直な上昇となりトレンド回復局面が継続しています。\n\nここから先はメンタルと財布の勝負になります。\n\nびびって引いても負け。\n\n資金がショートして買い負けても負け。\n\nどちらかが欠けてしまうと一気に不利なポジションに回されてしまいます。\n\n売りたい玉はだいぶ出尽くしている状況なので、あともう少し。\n\nいつまで続くのか、、、と不安になり疑心暗鬼になると自信を失ってとんでもない損失を確定してしまいます。\n\n大丈夫。相場に長くいれば必ず勝てます！\n\n相場に長くいること。\n諦めないこと。\nしつこく粘ること。\n\n性格の悪さが相場では大事です。\n\n年末相場に向けて前向きにいきましょう！！","post_type":"original","in_reply_to_id":null,"thread_root_id":null,"quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":null,"link_urls":[],"tickers_hint":["7936","9984","7012","5706","5801","3905","4385","6993","341A","288A"],"engagement":{"likes":151,"reposts":0,"replies":2,"views":12736}}\n{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2121259649051832527","post_url":"https://x.com/kioxiaman/status/2121259649051832527","author":"@kioxiaman","posted_at":"2026-11-13T15:11:26Z","collected_at":"2026-11-14T08:20:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-jp","text":"18🔞","post_type":"reply","in_reply_to_id":"2121248767383159211","thread_root_id":"2121248767383159211","quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":null,"link_urls":[],"tickers_hint":["285A"],"engagement":{"likes":1,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"views":92}}\n{"schema_version":"1.0","post_id":"2121248767383159211","post_url":"https://x.com/kioxiaman/status/2121248767383159211","author":"@kioxiaman","posted_at":"2026-11-13T14:28:11Z","collected_at":"2026-11-14T08:20:00+09:00","collected_by":"grok-automation/daily-jp","text":"立ち上がれ、サンディスク","post_type":"original","in_reply_to_id":null,"thread_root_id":null,"quoted_post_id":null,"quoted_text":null,"edited":false,"media_note":null,"link_urls":[],"tickers_hint":["285A"],"engagement":{"likes":53,"reposts":1,"replies":2,"views":3275}}